{"v":2,"id":"01M8GAA55QP16BT738FHFPFKYT","ts":"2026-11-28T05:33:39.383633Z","actor":"owner","type":"goal.add","node":"01M8GAA55QP16BT738FHFPFKYT","payload":{"role":"owner","words":"A Goal that rests on another Goal's select opens on that select with no act of the owner, lands only after the Goal it rests on has landed, and loses its work on a select the owner cuts.","base":"e83c7a69362b94636e9c27a235b34027d46f4954","base_tree":"f6d7f13cf0243a0e51bcda4897036020690b3ee1","budget":3,"from":"","lines":[{"key":"line-1","text":"The owner may add B with --from A and B's examples while A is in work; B stays written, and hyp status B says it waits for A's select.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-2","text":"When A is selected on a commit, B opens on that commit, with no act of the owner, when each of B's examples gives there the verdict its line needs.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-3","text":"When one of B's examples gives the wrong verdict on A's select, B stays written, and hyp status B lists that example and its verdict on that commit among what waits for the owner.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-4","text":"hyp land B is refused until A has landed, and until B's commit holds the commit A landed on.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-5","text":"After the owner unselects A's selected commit, B goes back to written: its rows on that commit stop counting, and it waits for A's next select.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-6","text":"When B opens again on A's next select, its rows on the cut commit use none of its three runs.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-7","text":"After the owner closes A, B waits for the owner, and hyp status B says that A was closed.","kind":"gap"},{"key":"line-8","text":"A Goal added with --from an ended Goal opens on its own H0, as today.","kind":"guard"}],"examples":[{"line":"line-1","example":"a","hash":"867a6f46bd18f3e05355aecab64c8d71955786a7","h0":{"commit":"e83c7a69362b94636e9c27a235b34027d46f4954","row_tree":"f6d7f13cf0243a0e51bcda4897036020690b3ee1","probe":"eeb946f4afc0e